    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nsugi, Balawī na Bagabīji",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū mhunhū ng'wenūyo ūnenha hangī ū kū mita gwa ha būshikīlo ū gw'ipandī lyeela, ī lipandī lya kīya īlo līgītīlījiwe; ū mita gwenūyo gwalī gūlugalilwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA ūniwīla, “Ū mita gwenūyū shiigelile gwikale gūlugalilwe, gūtizūlugūlwa; atīho wa kūbītīla ho. Ū goi shiigelile gwikale gūlugalilwe kūlwa nguno ū SEEBA, ū Mulungu wa Isilaeli, wingīlīlaga henaha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nsugi dūhū iyene h'ūyo azunīlīgije kwigasha ū mu wigasho bo ha mita na kūlya shilīwa kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA. A ha kwingīla akūbītīla ng'wibīndo lya mu mita, nū kūfuma ūfumīla nzīla yenīyo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū munhū ng'wenūyo ūnibītya kū mita gwa sukuma ūnenha kū būtongi bo hekalu. Aho naalola nūlībona ī likūjo lya ng'wa Seeba lyookalaga ū mu hekalu ya ng'wa SEEBA, nūgwa hasī nabundaalile.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA ūniwīla, “Ng'wana wa munhū, lolaga gete witegeleja, ūdegeleke chiza, hama wīgoyele na welwa ng'holò pyī ī īyo nalīkūwīla kūlwa kajīle kose ka mihayo ya hekalu ya ng'wa SEEBA. Ī ya nyango gwa kwingīla mu hekalu īdīlīlage, nī ya mapande gangī a ga kūfuma na kwingīla ng'wipandī lyeela.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhū ba numba ya Isilaeli, īyo īlī numba ya būshitiigwa bawīlage, “Ū Seeba MULUNGU alīhaya gīkī, Bing'we numba ya Isilaeli ng'wigegije lūūlū ī haha ī shītwa shing'we sha malofu! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A higūlya ya shītwa shing'we sha malofu ī shose, mukwenhaga banhū ba mahanga ū ng'wipandī lyane lyeela, banhū basoso mu ng'holò na mu nhūngwa ja mīlī. Mukūnenhelaga shilīwa na maguta na mininga, alīyo ū kūnū ng'wīsosohaja ī hekalu yane na kūlīkenaagūla ī lilagane lyane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A ha ng'wanya gwa kwīyīta bing'we benekīlī ī milīmo īyo īng'wigelilwe kūlwa wela bone, mukūtūūlaga banhū ba mahanga gīkī balīlang'hane ī lipandī lyane lyeela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alilūūlū, ū Seeba MULUNGU alīhaya gīkī, Munhū wa mahanga ūyo alī nsoso mu ng'holò na mu nhūngwa ja mīlī, atī wa kwingīla ng'wipandī lyane lyeela; pyī nūūlū na a banhū ba mahanga abo bakwikalaga ū mu Baisilaeli.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo a Balawī bakūgūbūūcha ū nsango ūyo gūlabagwīle kūlwa shibi shabo, abo bakanileka būūtagaalīja būja bakūlondeelaga shiikolile sha kūlamiwa aho Baisilaeli baalī baatala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Badūgije ū kūtūmama ū ng'wipandī lyeela, nūūlū kūlang'hana ha mibita ya hekalu nū kūtūmama būtūmama moi; nī mitugo ja shitambò sha kūpemvwa nī ja shitambò sha banhū badūgije ū kūjisīnza, nū kwīmīīla kū būtongi wa banhū, na kūbatūmamīla badūgije. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo īkī baabatongeelaga mu wilamīlīja kū mashiikolile gabo ga kūlamiwa, ī numba ya Isilaeli bīyenheleja kūgwa mu shiībī, ū nene naamala kwilahīla nanungije nkono ng'wigūlya, gīkī bakūgūbūūcha ū nsango gwa shibi shabo; alīhaya Seeba MULUNGU. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Batīko ū kwegeela na kūnitūmamīla nīmo gwa bagabīji, nūūlū kūshegeela ī shikolo shane ī sheela; nūūlū ī shakwinha sheela no no no īsho shikakafunyiagwa kūlwa nguno yane; bakūgūbūūcha ū nsango gwa shītīle shabo sh'ipelanya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike nakūbatūūla ha būtaale bo ndīīma ja milīmo ya mu hekalu, nī yose īyo yigelile kwītwa moi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo a bagabīji a Balawī, a balekwa Sadoki abo baalī bajidiimile ī ndīīma ja ng'wipandī lyane lyeela ū ng'wikanza īlo Baisilaeli baalī baatagaalīja būnileka, a benabo bakwiza banitūmamīle, bakwīmīīla kū būtongi bone kūfunya shitambò sha masazu na mininga; alīhaya Seeba MULUNGU. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A benabo h'abo bakwingīla ū ng'wipandī lyane lyeela, boi dūhū h'abo bakwegeela a ha meeza yane kūtūmama kū būtongi bone, na kwīyīta ī milīmo yane.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū bingīla ū mu mita go gwalugwa ya mu gatī, shibiigelile bazwale shizwalo sha kitaani, ūlū balītūmama mu mita go gwalugwa ya mu gatī nūūlū ū mu gatī ya hekalu, yaya kūzwala shizwalwa shose shose sha booya bo ng'holo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū kū mitwe yabo bakwitunga shikooye sha kitaani, nī shizwalo sha mu gatī ī sha kūzwala mu nkīmbīlī shibize sha kitaani; yaya kūzwala shose shose īsho shidūgije kūbenheleja kūūyīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū balīfuma kūja mu gwalugwa ya hanze ūko balī a banhū, shibiigelile bashizuule ī shizwalo sha kūtūmamīla; bakūshileka mu chumba sheela, bazwale shizwalo shingī, batizūbenheleja a banhū kūpandīka makoye kūlwa shizwalo shabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44:19",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Shizwalo shabo:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nūūlū, sha mhola.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaya ū kūmooga ipala ī mitwe yabo, nūūlū kūjileka ī nzwīlī jabo jizuuke mishinji mitaale, alīyo bakūyūjisūnzūūla, jiikale nguhī ja malīngīīla ū kū mitwe yabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ngabīji ūyo akwingīla mu gwalugwa ya mu gatī atizūng'wa divai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Batazunīlīgije kūtoola bakīma abo bachīlilwe bagoshi babo, nūūlū abo baalekwa na bagoshi babo; a boi ba kūtoola banhya ba būbyīle wa Baisilaeli, nūūlū bakīma abo baachīlwa bagooshi babo abo baalī bagabīji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bagabīji shibigelile kūbalanga a banhū bane badeebe ū kūlekanya a ha gatī ya shikolo ī sheela nī shisho shitī sheela, na kūboolekeja ūmo badūgije kūshikomanya ī shisoso nī sheela.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū wilonga wilemeelwa ha gatī ya banhū, a bagabīji h'a balamuji, nīyo balamule kūlondeela ūmo kalī a katongeelele kane. Shibiigelile bashilang'hane ī shilagīlo na a malange gane ū mu mihayo ya shikū jose ī ja shigukulu ījo jihelilwe; nī sabato jane bajilang'hane jiikale neela.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ngabīji atizisosohaja kūlwa kwegeela ha mimba gwa munhū; gwike ū munhū ūyo wachaaga ūlū walī ise nūūlū nina, ng'witūnja nūūlū nshīke wakwe, ng'wanong'wawe ngosha nūūlū ilūmbūye ūyo atatoolilwe, a henaho adūgije ū kwisosohaja kūlwa nguno yabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū ūmala ū kwejiwa shiigelile alindīīle shikū mpungatī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu lūshikū lwa kwingīla mu gwalugwa ya mu gatī ī y'ipandī lyeela kūjūtūmama ū ng'wipandī lyenīlo, akūfunya shitambò sha kweja shibi kūlwa nguno yakwe; alīhaya Seeba MULUNGU.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nene iyene hū nakūbiza wingīji ūbo būbigeleelilwe a bagabīji. Mutizūbinha sabo yose yose ū mu sī ya Isilaeli; ū nene hū nakūbiza sabo yabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakūyūlya ī shitambò sha būsu nī shitambò sha kweja shibi nī shitambò sha kwīnja būhūbi. Shose na shose ū mu Isilaeli īsho shūfunyiwa kūlwa ng'wa SEEBA shikūbiza shabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A matwajo ga kwandya ū mu shakwinha shing'we ī shawiza no no no gakūbiza ga bagabīji. Ū mu būsu wing'we ūbo būshiile ī sūnge ya kwandya mukūbinha boi, īlūkīlwe ī kaya jing'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bagabīji batī ba kūlya shose shose, ībize noni nūūlū ndimu, ya kūsola īchiile iyene nūūlū yabūlagagwa shiinū ja mu masaka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
